WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.057
Before creating a static pivot, inspect the distinct category values in the source.

00:00:06.057 --> 00:00:10.777
For example, list all diagnoses or all products.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:16.847
If new categories are already present but your pivot only has columns for older categories,

00:00:16.847 --> 00:00:20.127
those new values may disappear from the report.

00:00:20.127 --> 00:00:25.772
Checking the categories first helps you decide which columns the report should contain.
